 4242","  4242 qemu-system-x86","  4249 CPU 0/KVM","  4251 IO mon_iothread","  4260 worker"],"hl":[4],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[8.9,18.1,27.0]}]},{"title":"gdb: threads and stacks","sub":"Chapter 29 · QEMU and kernel sources","short":"gdb","main":"Attach, list the threads, take the stacks and exit.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Command","Thread","No symbols","Symbols"],"captions":["-p attaches, -batch -ex runs and exits","A thread header: number, LWP, name","Without debug info: a library or ??","With symbols: function, arguments, file:line"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["gdb -p 4242 -batch -ex 'info threads' \\","    -ex 'thread apply all bt'","Thread 2 (... (LWP 4249) \"CPU 0/KVM\"):","#0  0x7f1c in ioctl () from libc.so.6","#2  0x55d4 in kvm_cpu_exec (cpu=0x55d4)","    at ../accel/kvm/kvm-all.c:3464"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["gdb -p 4242 -batch -ex 'info threads' \\","    -ex 'thread apply all bt'","Thread 2 (... (LWP 4249) \"CPU 0/KVM\"):","#0  0x7f1c in ioctl () from libc.so.6","#2  0x55d4 in kvm_cpu_exec (cpu=0x55d4)","    at ../accel/kvm/kvm-all.c:3464"],"hl":[2],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["gdb -p 4242 -batch -ex 'info threads' \\","    -ex 'thread apply all bt'","Thread 2 (... (LWP 4249) \"CPU 0/KVM\"):","#0  0x7f1c in ioctl () from libc.so.6","#2  0x55d4 in kvm_cpu_exec (cpu=0x55d4)","    at ../accel/kvm/kvm-all.c:3464"],"hl":[3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["gdb -p 4242 -batch -ex 'info threads' \\","    -ex 'thread apply all bt'","Thread 2 (... (LWP 4249) \"CPU 0/KVM\"):","#0  0x7f1c in ioctl () from libc.so.6","#2  0x55d4 in kvm_cpu_exec (cpu=0x55d4)","    at ../accel/kvm/kvm-all.c:3464"],"hl":[4,5],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[10.2,19.4,28.8]}]},